    "original_reconstruction": "Original formal-only judgment, unchanged: on Fin 2 over C, the literal Pauli X matrix [[0,1],[1,0]] is unitary and sends e0 to e1; the literal Hadamard matrix (sqrt(2)/2)*[[1,1],[1,-1]] is unitary and sends e0 to the equal positive superposition. Both concrete target normalization propositions are squared-norm sums equal to 1. The one-gate symbolic X/H lists have recorded costs (auxiliary, gates, depth, oracle)=(0,1,1,0). Crucial limitation: ComplexStatePreparationCertificate.verified accepts arbitrary circuit, schedule and resource annotations without proving that the symbolic list denotes its certified matrix or that those annotations are accurate. Generic normalization and isUnitary fields are arbitrary Props; actual complex matrix unitarity comes from the stronger concrete gate certificate. Full 29-declaration and proof-body reconstruction remains in original reconstruction.md sections 1-3 and 5; no original conclusion has been upgraded by this binding.",
